# U2a: tell pi's loadSkillsFromDir scanner to skip the shared helpers
# subtree entirely. `_shared/` holds OOXML toolchain code used by docx /
# xlsx / pptx via $KNOWCLAW_SKILLS_DIR, not skills in their own right.
# Without this rule pi would still recurse through ~50 XSD files and
# helpers/validators/ looking for SKILL.md — wasted I/O on every startup.
_shared/
